    content: "When a temporary user state is no longer needed, you can call the `removeState` method to remove it. When the user state is removed, the user who has subscribed to the channel and enabled the presence event monitoring receives the `presence` notification in the `REMOTE_STATE_CHANGED` type. For details, see Event Listener."
